fixture pogo_chain_window_early_press
doc BUILD.md s5 Pogo "Chain window: next down-strike can start on frame 6 after a bounce"; s5 feel rules "Buffers are generous (8 f)"
room test/spikes
spawn 1216 300
frames 70
input
  0..11 D
  12..13 D attack
  14..16 D
  # Pressed on bounce frame 4 (the bounce, frame 14, is frame 1): kept, and it starts on frame 6.
  17 D attack
  18..69 D
end
expect
  at 14 event.pogo=1 since_bounce=1
  at 17 since_bounce=4 event.attack=0
  at 19 event.attack=1 action=down since_bounce=6
end
